        "\\qquad\n",
        "C(a)=2.\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "With no smoothing,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\widehat p(b\\mid a)=\\frac{1}{2},\n",
        "\\qquad\n",
        "\\widehat p(c\\mid a)=\\frac{1}{2}.\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "If the vocabulary is\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "V=\\{a,b,c,d,\\langle/ s\\rangle\\},\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "then $|V|=5$.  With add-$\\alpha$ smoothing and $\\alpha=1$,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\widehat p_1(b\\mid a)=\\frac{1+1}{2+5}=\\frac{2}{7},\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\widehat p_1(c\\mid a)=\\frac{2}{7},\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
